  "limits": [
    "Inventory dates and cattle age coverage vary; do not treat this as a harmonized annual series.",
    "Farm definitions, coverage and location rules change. A farm can be a ranch; a reporting farm is neither a household nor a full-time job.",
    "Land assigned to farm headquarters can include acreage in adjoining counties. Land in farms is not identical to grazing land or all land physically inside the county.",
    "1954 and 1959 labor and equipment are sample estimates. Labor measures different seasonal weeks, not annual employment, unique people, or full-time equivalents. The 1935 measure has a further definition/reference-period break.",
